# Native library tests

## Glossary

| Term | Means |
|------|-------|
| normalizing a title | call: normalize_title("  SHIP  "), source: domain.tnt |
| exercising pure helpers | call: pure_checks(), source: cases.tnt |
| completing a disposable task | call: task_lifecycle(), source: cases.tnt |

Feature: Pure helpers
  id: feature.native_helpers

  Scenario: Normalize a title directly
    When normalizing a title
    → result is "ship"

  Scenario: Native structured assertions
    When exercising pure helpers
    → native assertions pass

Feature: Disposable task store
  id: feature.native_store

  Scenario: Complete one task in memory
    When completing a disposable task
    → native assertions pass
